{"seq":3,"slug":"tenant-identification-routing","title":"租户识别与路由机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations/tenant-identification-routing","wordCount":1327,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"租户识别与路由机制\">租户识别与路由机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>租户识别（Tenant Identification）</strong>：从入站请求中提取并验证租户标识符的过程</li>\n<li><strong>租户上下文传播（Context Propagation）</strong>：将租户身份信息在整个调用链中传递的机制</li>\n<li><strong>数据源路由（Data Source Routing）</strong>：根据租户元数据将请求导向正确的数据存储后端</li>\n<li><strong>AsyncLocalStorage / ThreadLocal</strong>：在异步/多线程环境中维持请求级上下文的技术手段</li>\n<li><strong>交叉校验</strong>：多个来源的租户标识（子域名、JWT、Header）必须一致的安全原则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"租户识别的核心职责\">租户识别的核心职责</h2><p>租户识别是多租户系统的「第一道关」——每个入站请求必须在调用链的最早期被关联到一个明确的租户上下文。这一步一旦出错（误识别、漏识别），后续所有隔离机制形同虚设。</p>\n<p>租户识别需完成三件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>提取</strong>：从请求中获取租户标识符</li>\n<li><strong>验证</strong>：确认该标识符对应合法且活跃的租户</li>\n<li><strong>注入</strong>：将验证后的租户上下文注入请求生命周期，贯穿整个调用链</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as 客户端&#10;    participant GW as API 网关&#10;    participant MW as 租户中间件&#10;    participant Cache as 租户缓存&#10;    participant DB as 租户注册表&#10;    participant App as 业务服务&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;GW: 请求(含租户信号)&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;MW: 提取租户标识&#10;    MW-&gt;&gt;Cache: 查询租户元数据&#10;    alt 缓存命中&#10;        Cache--&gt;&gt;MW: 租户上下文&#10;    else 缓存未命中&#10;        MW-&gt;&gt;DB: 查询租户注册表&#10;        DB--&gt;&gt;MW: 租户元数据&#10;        MW-&gt;&gt;Cache: 写入缓存&#10;    end&#10;    MW-&gt;&gt;MW: 验证租户状态(active/suspended/deleted)&#10;    MW-&gt;&gt;App: 注入租户上下文&#10;    App--&gt;&gt;Client: 响应\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 客户端\n    participant GW as API 网关\n    participant MW as 租户中间件\n    participant Cache as 租户缓存\n    participant DB as 租户注册表\n    participant App as 业务服务\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;GW: 请求(含租户信号)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;MW: 提取租户标识\n    MW-&gt;&gt;Cache: 查询租户元数据\n    alt 缓存命中\n        Cache--&gt;&gt;MW: 租户上下文\n    else 缓存未命中\n        MW-&gt;&gt;DB: 查询租户注册表\n        DB--&gt;&gt;MW: 租户元数据\n        MW-&gt;&gt;Cache: 写入缓存\n    end\n    MW-&gt;&gt;MW: 验证租户状态(active/suspended/deleted)\n    MW-&gt;&gt;App: 注入租户上下文\n    App--&gt;&gt;Client: 响应</pre><h2 id=\"租户标识提取策略\">租户标识提取策略</h2><p>实践中有五种主流的租户标识提取方式，各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提取方式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子域名</td>\n<td><code>acme.app.com</code></td>\n<td>天然隔离入口、CDN 友好</td>\n<td>DNS 配置成本、通配符证书</td>\n<td>B2B SaaS 标准方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求头</td>\n<td><code>X-Tenant-Id: acme</code></td>\n<td>实现简单、不影响 URL 结构</td>\n<td>易被篡改、需配合鉴权</td>\n<td>内部服务间调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JWT Claim</td>\n<td><code>payload.org_id</code></td>\n<td>已签名防篡改、无额外传输</td>\n<td>Token 刷新前不可变</td>\n<td>移动端/API 优先场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>URL 路径</td>\n<td><code>/tenants/acme/orders</code></td>\n<td>RESTful 语义清晰</td>\n<td>侵入 URL 设计</td>\n<td>管理后台/admin API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询参数</td>\n<td><code>?tenant=acme</code></td>\n<td>最简实现</td>\n<td>不安全、易泄露</td>\n<td>仅用于内部调试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐组合策略：</strong> 子域名用于用户端入口路由（决定流量走向哪个隔离分区），JWT Claim 用于服务间调用的租户上下文传播（防篡改且自包含）。两者必须一致——网关层做交叉校验，子域名解析出的 tenant_id 必须与 JWT 中的 org_id 匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"租户上下文传播机制\">租户上下文传播机制</h2><p>识别出租户后，上下文需在整个请求生命周期中可访问。不同技术栈的实现模式：</p>\n<p><strong>同步请求链（HTTP 线程模型）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Node.js AsyncLocalStorage 方案&#10;import { AsyncLocalStorage } from &#39;node:async_hooks&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface TenantContext {&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;  tier: &#39;silo&#39; | &#39;bridge&#39; | &#39;pool&#39;;&#10;  region: string;&#10;  dbEndpoint: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const tenantStorage = new AsyncLocalStorage&lt;TenantContext&gt;();&#10;&#10;function tenantMiddleware(req, res, next) {&#10;  const tenantId = extractTenantId(req);&#10;  const context = resolveTenantContext(tenantId);&#10;  tenantStorage.run(context, () =&gt; next());&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getCurrentTenant(): TenantContext {&#10;  const ctx = tenantStorage.getStore();&#10;  if (!ctx) throw new Error(&#39;No tenant context - request not routed through tenant middleware&#39;);&#10;  return ctx;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Node.js AsyncLocalStorage 方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AsyncLocalStorage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:async_hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silo'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dbEndpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenantStorage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AsyncLocalStorage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tenantMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractTenantId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveTenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tenantStorage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCurrentTenant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenantStorage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'No tenant context - request not routed through tenant middleware'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>异步消息处理：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 生产者&#10;        P[业务服务] --&gt;|发布消息| Q[消息队列]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 消息头&#10;        Q --&gt;|tenant_id&lt;br/&gt;correlation_id&lt;br/&gt;source_service| H[Message Headers]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 消费者&#10;        H --&gt; MW2[租户上下文恢复]&#10;        MW2 --&gt; C[消费逻辑]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 生产者\n        P[业务服务] --&gt;|发布消息| Q[消息队列]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 消息头\n        Q --&gt;|tenant_id&lt;br/&gt;correlation_id&lt;br/&gt;source_service| H[Message Headers]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 消费者\n        H --&gt; MW2[租户上下文恢复]\n        MW2 --&gt; C[消费逻辑]\n    end</pre><p>关键原则：<strong>租户上下文必须作为消息头/元数据显式传播</strong>，绝不依赖消费者端的推断。消息体中的 tenant_id 与消息头中的 tenant_id 必须一致，不一致时拒绝处理并告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由决策与数据源选择\">路由决策与数据源选择</h2><p>租户识别完成后，路由层根据租户元数据决定请求被导向哪个数据源：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    REQ[请求 + 租户上下文] --&gt; ROUTER{路由决策}&#10;&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = silo| SILO_LOOKUP[查询专属 DB 连接信息]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = bridge| BRIDGE_LOOKUP[查询所属 DB + Schema]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = pool| POOL_LOOKUP[使用共享连接池 + 注入 tenant_id]&#10;&#10;    SILO_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN1[专属连接池]&#10;    BRIDGE_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN2[SET search_path = tenant_schema]&#10;    POOL_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN3[共享连接池 + RLS context]&#10;&#10;    CONN1 --&gt; EXEC[执行查询]&#10;    CONN2 --&gt; EXEC&#10;    CONN3 --&gt; EXEC\">graph TD\n    REQ[请求 + 租户上下文] --&gt; ROUTER{路由决策}\n\n    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = silo| SILO_LOOKUP[查询专属 DB 连接信息]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = bridge| BRIDGE_LOOKUP[查询所属 DB + Schema]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|tier = pool| POOL_LOOKUP[使用共享连接池 + 注入 tenant_id]\n\n    SILO_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN1[专属连接池]\n    BRIDGE_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN2[SET search_path = tenant_schema]\n    POOL_LOOKUP --&gt; CONN3[共享连接池 + RLS context]\n\n    CONN1 --&gt; EXEC[执行查询]\n    CONN2 --&gt; EXEC\n    CONN3 --&gt; EXEC</pre><p>路由元数据的典型数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TenantRoutingConfig {&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;  isolationTier: &#39;silo&#39; | &#39;bridge&#39; | &#39;pool&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // Silo 配置&#10;  dedicatedDbHost?: string;&#10;  dedicatedDbPort?: number;&#10;  dedicatedDbName?: string;&#10;&#10;  // Bridge 配置&#10;  sharedDbHost?: string;&#10;  schemaName?: string;&#10;&#10;  // Pool 配置（使用默认共享连接）&#10;  poolClusterId?: string;&#10;&#10;  // 通用&#10;  region: string;&#10;  readReplicaEnabled: boolean;&#10;  maxConnectionsPerTenant: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantRoutingConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isolationTier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silo'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Silo 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dedicatedDbHost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dedicatedDbPort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dedicatedDbName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Bridge 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sharedDbHost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  schemaName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Pool 配置（使用默认共享连接）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  poolClusterId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 通用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  readReplicaEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxConnectionsPerTenant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高可用与容错设计\">高可用与容错设计</h2><p>租户路由本身是单点——如果路由服务不可用，所有请求都无法到达正确的数据源。必须的容错策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障场景</th>\n<th>应对策略</th>\n<th>恢复时间目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>租户缓存失效</td>\n<td>多级缓存（L1 进程内 + L2 Redis）</td>\n<td>&lt; 10ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租户注册表 DB 宕机</td>\n<td>本地缓存 + 降级为只读</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由配置错误</td>\n<td>配置变更需灰度验证 + 回滚机制</td>\n<td>&lt; 30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS 解析失败（子域名方案）</td>\n<td>客户端 DNS 缓存 + fallback IP</td>\n<td>&lt; TTL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租户状态变更延迟</td>\n<td>Event-driven 缓存失效（pub/sub）</td>\n<td>&lt; 5s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>租户解析结果缓存策略：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TTL</strong>：租户元数据变更不频繁，缓存 5-15 分钟</li>\n<li><strong>失效触发</strong>：租户状态变更（暂停/删除）通过事件总线实时通知所有节点失效</li>\n<li><strong>负缓存</strong>：不存在的租户 ID 也要缓存（防止恶意扫描打穿数据库），TTL 缩短至 1 分钟</li>\n<li><strong>预热</strong>：服务启动时批量加载活跃租户到本地缓存</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安全加固-防御租户识别攻击\">安全加固：防御租户识别攻击</h2><p>租户识别环节是攻击面的集中点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击向量</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>防御措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>租户 ID 枚举</td>\n<td>暴力尝试获取其他租户数据</td>\n<td>UUID 替代自增 ID + 速率限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Header 伪造</td>\n<td>篡改 X-Tenant-Id 访问他人数据</td>\n<td>仅信任签名 JWT，Header 仅供内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子域名劫持</td>\n<td>注册他人子域名获取流量</td>\n<td>子域名与租户绑定验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JWT 重放</td>\n<td>使用过期 Token 访问</td>\n<td>短 TTL + Token Binding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文泄露</td>\n<td>线程池复用导致串租户</td>\n<td>请求结束强制 clear + 单测覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>防御的核心原则：<strong>Never trust, always verify</strong>。即使在内部服务间调用中，也要校验传播的租户上下文与调用链的鉴权信息一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 防御性租户上下文校验&#10;function validateTenantContext(req: Request, jwtPayload: JwtPayload) {&#10;  const headerTenantId = req.headers[&#39;x-tenant-id&#39;];&#10;  const jwtTenantId = jwtPayload.org_id;&#10;  const subdomainTenantId = extractFromSubdomain(req.hostname);&#10;&#10;  // 所有来源必须一致&#10;  if (headerTenantId &amp;&amp; headerTenantId !== jwtTenantId) {&#10;    throw new SecurityViolation(&#39;Tenant context mismatch: header vs JWT&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  if (subdomainTenantId &amp;&amp; subdomainTenantId !== jwtTenantId) {&#10;    throw new SecurityViolation(&#39;Tenant context mismatch: subdomain vs JWT&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return jwtTenantId; // JWT 作为权威源&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 防御性租户上下文校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateTenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">jwtPayload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JwtPayload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> headerTenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-tenant-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jwtTenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jwtPayload.org_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subdomainTenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractFromSubdomain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.hostname);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 所有来源必须一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (headerTenantId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headerTenantId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jwtTenantId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SecurityViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Tenant context mismatch: header vs JWT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (subdomainTenantId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subdomainTenantId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jwtTenantId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SecurityViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Tenant context mismatch: subdomain vs JWT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jwtTenantId; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// JWT 作为权威源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>租户识别与路由是多租户系统的入口守门人——它决定了请求的安全归属和数据流向。推荐采用子域名 + JWT 双重识别的组合策略，用 AsyncLocalStorage 或 ThreadLocal 实现上下文的全链路传播，并在路由层支持多种隔离模型的透明切换。安全加固的核心原则是「Never trust, always verify」——即使在内部服务间调用中也要校验租户上下文的一致性。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"isolation-models-comparison\">隔离模型对比分析</a> 详细说明了每种隔离模型的特征与选型依据。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户识别与路由机制","id":"租户识别与路由机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"租户识别的核心职责","id":"租户识别的核心职责"},{"level":2,"text":"租户标识提取策略","id":"租户标识提取策略"},{"level":2,"text":"租户上下文传播机制","id":"租户上下文传播机制"},{"level":2,"text":"路由决策与数据源选择","id":"路由决策与数据源选择"},{"level":2,"text":"高可用与容错设计","id":"高可用与容错设计"},{"level":2,"text":"安全加固：防御租户识别攻击","id":"安全加固-防御租户识别攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"隔离模型对比分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations/isolation-models-comparison"},"next":{"title":"独立数据库模式（Database-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/database-per-tenant"}}